Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:03.33,Speaker 1,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Hi, today we're testing the subtitle generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:04.37,Speaker 2,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:07.47,Speaker 2,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,I've prepared a very long sentence with plenty of commas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:10.47,Speaker 2,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,so we can check how the tool splits it into parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:14.85,Speaker 2,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,without breaking a phrase in the middle, and without exceeding the line length.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:18.45,Speaker 1,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,What happens if I pause... and then continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:22.11,Speaker 3,Speaker 3,0,0,0,,А теперь короткая фраза по-русски.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:24.33,Speaker 4,Speaker 4,0,0,0,,Y una frase corta en español.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:25.61,Speaker 2,Speaker 2,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:28.29,Speaker 1,Speaker 1,0,0,0,,Okay, that's the end of the test.
